===Format===
* '''Stage 1:'''
** Four round-robin format groups
*** Each group has 5 or 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top two or three teams from each group advance to Stage 2

* '''Stage 2:'''
** Four double-elimination format (GSL) Groups
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Top two teams from each group advance to the Playoffs

* '''Playoffs:'''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

